54:41.520-0400\",\"updateAuthor\":{\"accountId\":\"61aa32d2ef18ca0071a5abec\",\"displayName\":\"Rajith Suvarna\"},\"jsdPublic\":true},{\"id\":\"3364818\",\"author\":{\"accountId\":\"712020:688bd119-6d13-450b-95ac-b1ef3fbb547b\",\"displayName\":\"Juan Martinez\"},\"body\":\"<p data-local-id=\\\"5599caa5\\\">Hello <span data-local-id=\\\"20f0f6d9-3c53-4d84-827e-78ca8eb0ad88\\\" data-type=\\\"mention\\\" data-user-id=\\\"qm:77071153-8149-425d-9cc5-2ef53c35a3bd:6d1c14d4-5252-4432-8d57-2260829c7fa1\\\">@Heaven Poirot</span> </p><p data-local-id=\\\"2c061bc0\\\">I will be taking over this ticket. <span data-local-id=\\\"baf3c428-000e-41d2-ab9d-e0c1621f900c\\\" data-type=\\\"mention\\\" data-user-id=\\\"61aa32d2ef18ca0071a5abec\\\">@Rajith Suvarna</span>  has already pushed a verification update earlier. We are currently awaiting your response, as everything appears normal on our side at this time.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"5fa86b05\\\">Kind regards,</p>\",\"created\":\"2026-09-25T18:35:22.886-0400\",\"updated\":\"2026-09-25T18:35:22.886-0400\",\"updateAuthor\":{\"accountId\":\"712020:688bd119-6d13-450b-95ac-b1ef3fbb547b\",\"displayName\":\"Juan Martinez\"},\"jsdPublic\":true},{\"id\":\"3371826\",\"author\":{\"accountId\":\"712020:688bd119-6d13-450b-95ac-b1ef3fbb547b\",\"displayName\":\"Juan Martinez\"},\"body\":\"<p data-local-id=\\\"274fcf38da5e\\\">Hi <span data-local-id=\\\"6ff92174-5c8c-4823-8389-b020a9d34c7c\\\" data-type=\\\"mention\\\" data-user-id=\\\"qm:77071153-8149-425d-9cc5-2ef53c35a3bd:6d1c14d4-5252-4432-8d57-2260829c7fa1\\\">@Heaven Poirot</span> </p><p data-local-id=\\\"59c77d750928\\\">I wanted to follow up on the below ticket, as we haven&#039;t heard back since our last communication. We want to make sure we get this resolved for you and are ready to move forward as soon as we hear from you.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"1d5710a5f8e7\\\">Please let us know if you have any questions or need clarification on what&#039;s needed from your end. We&#039;re happy to help.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"7b531cb2d72f\\\">Thank you,</p><p data-local-id=\\\"a54e1a030a45\\\">Juan Martinez  | Appriss Retail Support </p>\",\"created\":\"2026-09-29T14:04:05.554-0400\",\"updated\":\"2026-09-29T14:04:05.554-0400\",\"updateAuthor\":{\"accountId\":\"712020:688bd119-6d13-450b-95ac-b1ef3fbb547b\",\"displayName\":\"Juan Martinez\"},\"jsdPublic\":true},{\"id\":\"3375404\",\"author\":{\"accountId\":\"557058:f58131cb-b67d-43c7-b30d-6b58d40bd077\",\"displayName\":\"Automation for Jira\"},\"body\":\"<p>Email sent to assignee informing that customer has not responded for 7 days.</p>\",\"created\":\"2026-10-02T09:05:58.947-0400\",\"updated\":\"2026-10-02T09:05:58.947-0400\",\"updateAuthor\":{\"accountId\":\"557058:f58131cb-b67d-43c7-b30d-6b58d40bd077\",\"displayName\":\"Automation for Jira\"},\"jsdPublic\":false},{\"id\":\"3382970\",\"author\":{\"accountId\":\"712020:688bd119-6d13-450b-95ac-b1ef3fbb547b\",\"displayName\":\"Juan Martinez\"},\"body\":\"<p data-local-id=\\\"ae10148a200d\\\">Hi <span data-local-id=\\\"f35cf451-690b-420a-8d44-165f7226bbac\\\" data-type=\\\"mention\\\" data-user-id=\\\"qm:77071153-8149-425d-9cc5-2ef53c35a3bd:6d1c14d4-5252-4432-8d57-2260829c7fa1\\\">@Heaven Poirot</span> </p><p data-local-id=\\\"d94cb82a9705\\\">Following up once more on the ticket below. We understand things can get busy, and it&#039;s also possible the issue may have resolved itself on your end, if that&#039;s the case, please let us know and we&#039;ll get this closed out for you.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"5c335e38c53b\\\">If you&#039;re still experiencing the issue, we&#039;re standing by and ready to continue our investigation. Just reply here with any updates and we&#039;ll pick things right back up.</p><p data-local-id=\\\"97531e62d4a5\\\">Thank you,<br>Juan Martinez  | Appriss Retail Support </p>\",\"created\":\"2026-10-06T15:10:26.708-0400\",\"updated\":\"2026-10-06T15:10:26.708-0400\",\"updateAuthor\":{\"accountId\":\"712020:688bd119-6d13-450b-95ac-b1ef3fbb